# ⚠ The **delta** from the root `.gitignore`, and only that. `node_modules`, `.next/`,
# `coverage/`, `build/`, `*.tsbuildinfo`, `.DS_Store` and `.env.*` are all covered there
# already; restating them here is how two ignore files drift into disagreeing. What remains is
# genuinely local to a Next + Fumadocs site.

# Generated by fumadocs-mdx from `content/`. Build input, not source.
.source

# `next export` output.
/out

# Vercel's local project link and build cache.
.vercel

# Certificates, if `next dev --experimental-https` is ever used here. Kept because a committed
# private key is not a mistake worth leaving to attention.
*.pem

# ⚠ `next-env.d.ts` is deliberately NOT ignored, matching `apps/rsc-fixture`, which commits it.
# It is named in `tsconfig.json`'s `include`, so committing it means a clean checkout can
# typecheck before it has ever built. Next regenerates it either way; the cost is one file of
# three lines, and the alternative is a typecheck whose result depends on whether a build ran.
